Early game was relatively easy, throwing daggers and
eventually 2-weaponing with daggers. In Minetown I sacced
lots of monsters and got Stormy.
Sokoban gave me "oRefl and Mines a BoH.

I got CoMR as a wand wish only after conquering the Castle.
Spellcasting monsters destroyed my cloaks and helmet but
nothing else.

In Quest End I had to poly into a xorn to get in and out of the
middle area. As a xorn, I got mesmerized by a guardian naga
and a nymph stole much of my stuff. However, I didn't even die
as a xorn but I got scared.

I emptied one bones level of mine, nothing interesting.

Polymorphing stuff in the Castle gave me lots of amulets of ls
and magic markers etc. etc. etc.
I actually casted "identify" at unskilled (46% fail), thanks to a robe.

My stack of +6 daggers took care of (m)mfs nicely.

In the Astral Plane, I cashed my magic lamp for a boulder to trap
Pestilence in the leftmost temple courtyard.

